msgid "Any domain you manage in Cloudflare and whose mail no other server handles, because Email Routing becomes its MX. Each e-mail channel has an address, or the catch-all *@example.com for every address of the domain that no channel has exactly. A subaddress such as support+billing@example.com reaches the channel of support@example.com."
msgstr "Qualquer domínio que gere no Cloudflare e cujo e-mail nenhum outro servidor trate, porque o Email Routing passa a ser o MX dele. Cada canal de e-mail tnum endereço, ou o catch-all *@example.com para todo endereço do domínio que nenhum canal tenha exatamente. Um subendereço como support+billing@example.com chega ao canal de support@example.com."

